/P 125 0 R
/E (    The project uses the Instacart Market Basket Analysis dataset, which consists of multiple relational files describing customer orders and purchased products. Order-level information is provided in orders.csv, while order_products__prior.csv contains the products included in each order and serves as the core table for building transactional baskets. Product metadata is enriched using products.csv, aisles.csv, and departments.csv, enabling the association of products with meaningful categories and supporting effective market basket analysis.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
